    "path": "/home/enpasos/projects/skillpilot/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-06/chemie-b008-colour-calibration-domain-targeted-author-v10/fifty-two-cases.de-en.author-candidate.json",
